    "pros": [
      "Rated about 17 gallons per day at a 120-degree plenum, per retailers",
      "Sized for homes up to 2,800 sq ft",
      "Five-year limited warranty listed by SupplyHouse",
      "Usually cheaper than equivalent Aprilaire and Honeywell units"
